    PAIN MANAGEMENT PROTOCOL IN EFFECT

    AUTHORIZED
    PERSONNEL ONLY. KNOCK AND WAIT FOR THE DOOR TO BE OPENED.

    For patients and
    families: it is common not to remember a session after induction. This is expected
    and normal, and your care team will be with you when you wake.'
